{"articleNo":"104082","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=104082&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"양호-신평간 셔틀버스 운행시간 조정 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2014.03.20","hit":"3835","attachments":[{"name":"양호 신평 셔틀시간표(3.24.부터).xls","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=104082&attachNo=72424"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 신평캠퍼스에 학과 이전 및 생활관생 입사에 따라 2주간(3월3일~14일) 1시간 간격으로 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">셔틀버스&nbsp; 운행 결과, 승차인원이 저조하고 학생들이 수업참여에 지장이 없는 시간대의 운행을 아래와 같이&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;조정하여 알려드리니 셔틀버스 이용에 착오없으시기 바랍니다.</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 1. 조정 내용 : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">양호(14:10)→신평(14:25)→ 양호(14:35) 운행폐지,</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\"> 1일 11회 운행</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2. 시행 기간 : </span><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">2014. 3.24.(월)부터 추후 운행시간 조정시 까지</span></u></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 단, 공휴일 및 휴무일은 운행하지 않음</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 3. 비 고 : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">광시스템공학과, 메디컬IT공학과 학생들의 수업시간표 및 셔틀버스 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">이용학생수를&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 참고하여 조정</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; **<strong> 3.24(월)부터 양호 -&gt;신평 18:15분 출발 차량은 </strong>디지털관 서편에서 승차하지 않고 <strong>그린에너지관 서편에서만 승차함</strong>(그외 시간대 승차장소는 변경 없음)</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">&nbsp; 붙임 : 양호-신평캠퍼스간 운행 시간표(3.24~) 1부.&nbsp; 끝.</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
